{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The young crown prince would have perished\u2014if not for the intervention of a necromancer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But the evil Priests motives were far from noble. He did not act for the prince, neither did he act for the kingdom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>He acted to tear open a rift to the Undead Plane\u2026 to weaken the ancient Barrier.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Now, the dead stir. The invasion looms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your mission: <u>You Need to stop what has begun</u>;\u00a0and seal the Barrier before it's too late.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of <i>Kaelthar</i>\u2014a land full of magic, adventure, and amazing powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path: pick your race, your class, and exciting quests to go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own hero with special skills, cool weapons, and powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use swords, spells, or potions to fight monsters and protect the world from danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Buy this game Now, because You want to become a Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>An Awesome Open-World RPG filled with Unique Demons and Powerful Dragons.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices Matter</strong> in this funny Sandbox type RPG, where you can take many different paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Customization</strong> is easy, with many different weapons, (Some you can make yourself), Many different colors for clothes, hats and armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read about the Crafting many, unique Sword and other things below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here are one of the Monsters; The Seven Head-Hydra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/hydra_orcfight-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter(1)?t=1752035732\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magic in this game is easy and wild\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features things like crafting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sword Crafting</strong>, where you can create your own sword from +250,000 Unique combinations. Swords and Armors can also be Improved with smiting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alchemy Crafting</strong>, with over 100,000 possible combinations to make a wide variety of potions. A cheap way to make money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spell Crafting</strong>, with over a million ways to combine spells\u2014from a simple fireball to a lightning storm that covers the whole map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enchanting:</strong> Make your character Unique with his own enchantments on weapons, Armour and Jewellery. Buy them in the many shops, or make them yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the RuneChild RPG. <br>You can play it casually\u2014taking your time to explore the world and complete quests\u2014or go full hardcore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s also a <strong>Fight Arena</strong> for players who want to dive straight into the action and face demons, monsters, and dragons with nothing but a simple sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between\u00a0<strong>Fighter, Ranger,\u00a0Rogue,</strong> or <strong>Wizard</strong>, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I love playing open-world RPGs like <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Morrowind</i>, as well as exploring Tolkien\u2019s universe. So, I\u2019ve taken the parts I enjoy most from them: the wild magic and alchemy from <i>Morrowind</i>, the bright colors of <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Skyrim</i>\u2019s weapon improvements.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Visit_WolfShire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/8ab1d9b80b192bcbc4c9969296bbe16671b255d2.jpg"},{"name":"VisitMossField","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/6cbb0ffd749d6aba9584fe6fe0865ca84eaba61d.jpg"},{"name":"Row Your Boat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/92639f450cb82409d0c5a64cf9b4ae1bf4c0cb9d.jpg"},{"name":"Just 5 more Minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/3a7785567e03485d6876e6afaef86ef60900311e.jpg"},{"name":"Sitting Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/8e4d14c74ee149305c88f94d26aed06e87fa780f.jpg"},{"name":"Riding a Mount ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/ebe620fe91c50b33e755e447bf278e6f18292d23.jpg"},{"name":"Killed a Golden Spider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/7a5687da4fccbf7e85d8d3f76e063173d512bd94.jpg"},{"name":"Open First Page","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/5ce8ac95a57d96b9c86f823df22598a352477ec2.jpg"},{"name":"Start as Human","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/7b867e2a2f71a16b432213fd9ec67697da8e190a.jpg"},{"name":"Start as Hafling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/9d7f8d101b15ef95000aab798cf78b003c7a8825.jpg"}],"total":62},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1078610?t=1752035732","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/70842d322931b3724ecddc1748819c77e0388f02/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752035732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/174c60abe059046480a4bbfb203fde88a513a7b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752035732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/174c60abe059046480a4bbfb203fde88a513a7b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752035732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2614440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The young crown prince would have perished\u2014if not for the intervention of a necromancer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But the evil Priests motives were far from noble. He did not act for the prince, neither did he act for the kingdom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>He acted to tear open a rift to the Undead Plane\u2026 to weaken the ancient Barrier.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Now, the dead stir. The invasion looms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your mission: <u>You Need to stop what has begun</u>;\u00a0and seal the Barrier before it's too late.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of <i>Kaelthar</i>\u2014a land full of magic, adventure, and amazing powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path: pick your race, your class, and exciting quests to go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own hero with special skills, cool weapons, and powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use swords, spells, or potions to fight monsters and protect the world from danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Buy this game Now, because You want to become a Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>An Awesome Open-World RPG filled with Unique Demons and Powerful Dragons.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices Matter</strong> in this funny Sandbox type RPG, where you can take many different paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Customization</strong> is easy, with many different weapons, (Some you can make yourself), Many different colors for clothes, hats and armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read about the Crafting many, unique Sword and other things below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here are one of the Monsters; The Seven Head-Hydra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/hydra_orcfight-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter(1)?t=1752035732\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magic in this game is easy and wild\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features things like crafting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sword Crafting</strong>, where you can create your own sword from +250,000 Unique combinations. Swords and Armors can also be Improved with smiting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alchemy Crafting</strong>, with over 100,000 possible combinations to make a wide variety of potions. A cheap way to make money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spell Crafting</strong>, with over a million ways to combine spells\u2014from a simple fireball to a lightning storm that covers the whole map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enchanting:</strong> Make your character Unique with his own enchantments on weapons, Armour and Jewellery. Buy them in the many shops, or make them yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the RuneChild RPG. <br>You can play it casually\u2014taking your time to explore the world and complete quests\u2014or go full hardcore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s also a <strong>Fight Arena</strong> for players who want to dive straight into the action and face demons, monsters, and dragons with nothing but a simple sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between\u00a0<strong>Fighter, Ranger,\u00a0Rogue,</strong> or <strong>Wizard</strong>, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I love playing open-world RPGs like <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Morrowind</i>, as well as exploring Tolkien\u2019s universe. So, I\u2019ve taken the parts I enjoy most from them: the wild magic and alchemy from <i>Morrowind</i>, the bright colors of <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Skyrim</i>\u2019s weapon improvements.</p>","developers":["J. C. SpringBourne"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image"